id: pm-brief-yanp
title: Replace the future-date empty-window fixture that blocks the PM 2026.10.25 toolchain CI
description: "Tracks gh:unbraind/pm-brief#193. The quiet-output fixture used a future activity lower bound without an upper bound and failed the host from-before-to contract. Already fixed by merged PR #192 (a4f1197), which uses the deterministic bounded pre-tracker window 1900-01-01 through 1900-01-02 and retains ok=true and truncated=false assertions. November 6 verification on main 977ff2b reproduced the old failure in a disposable copy and confirmed the fixed registered command plus a real SDK-seeded non-git tracker. This item remains open for orchestrator verification and GitHub issue closure; no implementation changes are needed."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags[4]: ci,"gh:unbraind/pm-brief#192","gh:unbraind/pm-brief#193",toolchain
created_at: "2026-11-02T09:16:26.337Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-06T15:19:24.031Z"
author: pi-glm
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-03T10:03:26.178Z",codex-toolchain-1103,"The bounded npm test run exposed the existing GH-193 fixture failure: brief since passed activity --from 2999-01-01 with implicit --to now, rejected as invalid_argument_value (Activity --from must be before --to). Root cause: pm-cli 2026.10.25 GH-1554 stable bounded activity window validation. Classification: test contract drift. Replace only this activity empty-window control with 1900-01-01 through 1900-01-02, before tracker history, retaining quiet ok=true and truncated=false assertions. Duplicate-list future since filters have no activity upper bound and remain valid empty-selection controls, so they are unchanged."
  "2026-11-03T10:06:07.092Z",codex-toolchain-1103,"The corrected bounded past-window test passes 1/1 directly (node --test --test-name-pattern=\"brief since requires a checkpoint\" test/coverage-gaps.test.ts), including until/text/slack outputs, quiet ok=true and truncated=false; it also passes through pm test. Typecheck, build:test and docstring pass after the fixture change. This is a test-only update; no activity admission behavior or duplicate since filters were changed. Leave open for coordinator verification."
  "2026-11-06T15:12:16.207Z",codex-sol,"Reverification for GH-193: origin/main at 977ff2b already contains the bounded pre-tracker window in a4f1197 (merged PR #192). Reuse this item; run the exact registered-command reproduction and a disposable-copy revert of that fixture before deciding closure evidence. No implementation changes planned for an already-delivered fix. Registry latest reports 2026.11.6; repository pin 2026.11.4 remains unchanged."
  "2026-11-06T15:15:31.481Z",codex-sol,"Already-fixed evidence: a4f1197 in merged PR #192 replaced only the invalid future lower bound with 1900-01-01 through 1900-01-02 in test/coverage-gaps.test.ts. Current origin/main 977ff2b passes the registered-command regression 1/1. In a disposable origin/main copy, reverting only that call to 2999-01-01 without until fails 0/1 with invalid_argument_value, Activity --from must be before --to (host exit 2); restoring the fixed call passes 1/1. Source and test code remain unchanged."
  "2026-11-06T15:15:38.694Z",codex-sol,"Additional isolated verification passed using a real PmClient-initialized non-git tracker with a newly created Task: bounded historical activity returns [], registered text file output equals the No changes line, receipt ok=true and truncated=false. Future-from-without-until and reversed explicit windows both still reject. No SDK mocks or production behavior changes. Typecheck, build:test and docstring pass (17 files, 200 declarations); no lint script exists. npm release:check is running serially before Bun with unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-11-06T15:18:39.507Z",codex-sol,"Fresh focused results: Node 22.23.4 and Node 26.13.0 each pass the registered-command test 1/1 with --test-concurrency=2; the linked pm test --run --only-last --progress also passes 1/1. Existing history remains a byte-identical prefix of this branch history. Changelog generation and check pass; generated content is currently unchanged. No new pm CLI/SDK defect was found. Plain gh issue view failed due to deprecated classic-project fields; the full issue and comments were read with explicit JSON fields."
  "2026-11-06T15:19:07.588Z",codex-sol,"Verification scope is closure evidence only: no source, tests, dependencies, workflow or thresholds changed. Node 22/26 focused checks, pm-linked execution, isolated SDK acceptance and disposable fixture-revert proof pass. Fresh full npm/Bun gate outcomes and final-head CI/review receipts will be reported on the single stable-empty-window-fixture PR; npm is still running and Bun will run serially. Leave this item open for the orchestrator; release only the codex-sol claim."
